## Appendix B: Affine Conjugacy Specification

For any 1D atom f with domain [lo, hi]:

```
h(x) = a·x + b           (conjugacy)
h_inv(y) = (y - b) / a   (inverse)

Transformed dynamics:
y_{n+1} = h(f(h_inv(y_n))) = a · f((y_n - b) / a) + b

Constraints:
  a ≠ 0  (invertibility)
  |a| ∈ [0.5, 5.0]  (numerical stability)
  |b| ∈ [0, 3.0]    (reasonable range)

New domain: [a·lo + b, a·hi + b]  (if a > 0)
           [a·hi + b, a·lo + b]  (if a < 0)
```

All dynamical invariants (Lyapunov exponent, h_KS, topological entropy, regime classification) are identical to the original system. Verification uses the original system's ground truth.
